<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 159,952.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 159,952.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of February 19 totaled 159,952 bales, up from 153,983 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 5,981 bales issued, no decertification orders, 12 cancellations, and 13,484 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
